    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>direct_messages_topic_id</term>
    /// <description>Integer. Optional. Identifier of the direct messages topic to which the message will be sent; required if the message is sent to a direct messages chat</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>from_chat_id</term>
    /// <description>Integer or String. Required. Unique identifier for the chat where the original message was sent (or username of the target bot, supergroup or channel in the format @username)</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>message_id</term>
    /// <description>Integer. Required. Message identifier in the chat specified in from_chat_id</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>video_start_timestamp</term>
    /// <description>Integer. Optional. New start timestamp for the copied video in the message</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>caption</term>
    /// <description>String. Optional. New caption for media, 0-1024 characters after entities parsing. If not specified, the original caption is kept.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>parse_mode</term>
    /// <description>String. Optional. Mode for parsing entities in the new caption. See formatting options for more details.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>caption_entities</term>
    /// <description>Array of MessageEntity. Optional. A JSON-serialized list of special entities that appear in the new caption, which can be specified instead of parse_mode</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>show_caption_above_media</term>
    /// <description>Boolean. Optional. Pass True, if the caption must be shown above the message media. Ignored if a new caption isn&apos;t specified.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>disable_notification</term>
    /// <description>Boolean. Optional. Sends the message silently. Users will receive a notification with no sound.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>protect_content</term>
    /// <description>Boolean. Optional. Protects the contents of the sent message from forwarding and saving</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
    /// <term>allow_paid_broadcast</term>
