    /// <term>suggested_post_parameters</term>
    /// <description>SuggestedPostParameters. Optional. A JSON-serialized object containing the parameters of the suggested post to send; for direct messages chats only. If the message is sent as a reply to another suggested post, then that suggested post is automatically declined.</description>
    /// </item>
    /// <item>
