    /// <term>country_codes</term>
    /// <description>Array of String. Optional. A JSON-serialized list of 0-12 two-letter ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country codes indicating the countries from which users can vote in the poll; for channel chats only. Use “FT” as a country code to allow users with anonymous numbers to vote. If omitted or empty, then users from any country can participate in the poll.</description>
